## Proposed Changes

### New Files (Zero existing files modified)

---

#### [NEW] `SIH/admin-routes.js`
Backend Express router that adds:
- `POST /api/admin/login` — validates username/password, issues a short-lived session token
- `DELETE /api/admin/problems/:id` — deletes a problem (token auth required)
- `GET /api/admin/problems` — returns all problems with extra admin metadata
- Token is stored in-memory (`Map`) with a 4-hour expiry — no external deps needed

---

#### [NEW] `SIH/admin.html`
Standalone HTML page at `/admin` route. Contains:
1. **Login Screen** — full-page glassmorphism login form (username + password)
2. **Admin Dashboard** (hidden until logged in) featuring:
   - Live **stats bar** (total, critical, solved, pending)
   - **Real-time problem feed** (polls server every 5 s)
   - Each problem card has a **🗑️ Delete** button (admin-only)
   - **Toggle Solved** button per card
   - **Category filter chips**
   - Live **"last updated"** timestamp
   - Logout button
3. Navigation button in the top-right that only appears on the admin page

---

#### [NEW] `SIH/admin.css`
Dedicated CSS for the admin panel:
- Premium dark glassmorphism design matching existing brand palette (`--accent-teal`, `--accent-coral`, etc.)
- Sidebar-style admin layout with stats at the top
- Red-tinted delete buttons with hover animation
- Animated "LIVE" indicator badge
- Responsive grid for problem cards

---

### Modified Files

#### [MODIFY] [`server.js`](file:///d:/samadhanhub/SIH/server.js)
**Only one line added** at the top of API routes section:
```diff
+ const adminRouter = require('./admin-routes');
+ app.use('/api/admin', adminRouter);
```
This mounts the admin API without touching any existing routes.

---

## Architecture Summary

```
Browser: /admin → admin.html
                    ↓ login form
POST /api/admin/login → admin-routes.js → validates → returns token
                    ↓ token stored in sessionStorage
GET /api/admin/problems (with Bearer token) → returns all problems
DELETE /api/admin/problems/:id (with Bearer token) → deletes problem
                    ↓ real-time polling every 5s
Admin dashboard auto-refreshes problem list
```

